{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roof Leak Hero is a game about having a leaky roof in the rain and catching water in pots while getting mad points for doing so. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/df6ce127aa3eacfd7f75c744eb86c40f.avif?t=1768583862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras_big/df6ce127aa3eacfd7f75c744eb86c40f.avif?t=1768583862 width=800 height=448 /></span>Try to keep things from flooding as long as possible and get the highest score! Click and hold to throw your containers and make trick shots to land them directly where you need them to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/c4da0a7aeec27c77ac826d13a5208ca6.avif?t=1768583862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras_big/c4da0a7aeec27c77ac826d13a5208ca6.avif?t=1768583862 width=800 height=450 /></span> Dump excess water into the drain and advance to the next point level to get point multipliers and reach even crazier scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras/6f119838ebedf9e6d9c0995f89b4cf09.avif?t=1768583862\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835950/extras_big/6f119838ebedf9e6d9c0995f89b4cf09.avif?t=1768583862 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835950?t=1768583862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835950?t=1768583862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/383595